  "instructions": [
    "Bring the water to a boil in a large pot.",
    "Add the bouillon cubes and whisk until dissolved.",
    "Add the noodle ramen to the pot and cook for 3 minutes.",
    "Add the soy sauce, sesame oil, garlic, salt, and black pepper to the pot and stir well.",
    "Reduce heat to low and simmer for 2 minutes.",
    "Stir in the chopped green onions.",
    "Serve hot and enjoy.",
    "Use a whisk to remove any excess starch from the noodles."
